              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बगळा — bagḷā — \"a heron; an egret\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "शेतात पांढरे बगळे बसले आहेत. śetāt pāṇḍhre bagḷe basle āhet. White egrets are sitting in the field."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine. Plural: बगळे, bagḷe."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The plural is बगळे."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
