          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बगळा (bagḷā) belongs with Sanskrit baka, \"a heron\" (CDIAL 9115); how the Marathi form was shaped is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
